Calendar with capacity tracking, reminders, and attendee management.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128226;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Announcements</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Rich text posts with emoji reactions. Pin the important ones.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128218;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Resource Library</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Files, links, and documents with member-only access control.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128172;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Forum</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Categories, topics, threaded replies, and moderation tools.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#127963;&#65039;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Committees</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Working groups with roles, member assignments, and descriptions.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#9999;&#65039;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Inline Editing</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">The page IS the admin panel. Click to edit, no separate dashboard.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#9889;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Config-Driven</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Restructure your entire site with SQL. No code changes needed.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n    </div>\\\\\\\\n  </section>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ======== AI FEATURES ======== -->\\\\\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section ai-section\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section-header\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">AI-Powered</p>\\\\\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Six AI features. Your API key.</h2>\\\\\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-body--lg mt-2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Every AI feature is optional, bring-your-own-key, and runs on your schedule. No vendor lock-in. No surprise bills from us.</p>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-grid\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128737;&#65039;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Content Moderation</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Auto-flag spam and toxicity. Review queue for admins. Runs every 15 minutes.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#127760;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Auto-Translation</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Publish once, serve in any language. Triggered on content publish.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128240;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Newsletter Writer</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">AI drafts your weekly update from recent activity. You approve and send.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#127919;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Smart Onboarding</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Personalized welcome message for each new member based on their profile.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128202;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Member Insights</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Spot at-risk members before they leave. Daily analysis of engagement patterns.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#128221;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Event Recaps</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">AI writes the post-event summary from attendance and photos. You approve it.</div>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ai-byok\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        &#128273;&ensp; Bring your own API key. Your AI, your cost, your control.\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n    </div>\\\\\\\\n  </section>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ======== WHO IT'S FOR ======== -->\\\\\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section section--cream\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niches\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Who It's For</p>\\\\\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Built for communities of every kind.</h2>\\\\\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-body--lg mt-2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Wild Lychee adapts to your community type with niche-specific templates, features, and seed data.</p>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-grid\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/churches.html\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#9961;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Churches &amp; Religious Orgs</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Sermons, prayer requests, small groups</div>\\\\\\\\n        </a>\\\\\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/associations.html\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#127970;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Professional Associations</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Directory, committees, conferences</div>\\\\\\\\n        </a>\\\\\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/sports.html\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#9917;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Sports Leagues &amp; Clubs</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Rosters, schedules, standings</div>\\\\\\\\n        </a>\\\\\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/hoa.html\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__icon\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&#127968;</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">HOAs &amp; Condos</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"niche-card__sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Maintenance, documents, voting</div>\\\\\\\\n        </a>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n    </div>\\\\\\\\n  </section>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ======== PRICING ======== -->\\\\\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section section--white\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"pricing\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Pricing</p>\\\\\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Simple, transparent pricing.</h2>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plans-grid\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">DIY Template</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__price\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Free</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__price-sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">+ $5&ndash;20/mo Run402 hosting</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"For developers and AI agents.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"</div>\\\\\\\\n          <ul class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__features\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n            <li>Full source code (open source)</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>All features included</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Self-deploy to Run402</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Community support</li>\\\\\\\\n          </ul>\\\\\\\\n          <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://github.com/kychee-com/wildlychee\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"btn btn--outline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Fork on GitHub</a>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card plan-card--featured\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Studio Build</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__price\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">$29</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__price-sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">one-time + $5&ndash;20/mo hosting</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Tell us about your community. Live in 5 minutes.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"</div>\\\\\\\\n          <ul class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__features\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n            <li>AI investigates your existing site</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Guided interview &rarr; custom portal</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Brand colors, logo, content migrated</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Multi-language translation</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Chrome-verified deployment</li>\\\\\\\\n          </ul>\\\\\\\\n          <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"btn btn--primary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">See a Demo First &rarr;</a>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Lychee Pro</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__price\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">$9&ndash;29/mo</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__price-sub\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ongoing, cancel anytime</div>\\\\\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__desc\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Your portal evolves with you.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"</div>\\\\\\\\n          <ul class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"plan-card__features\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n            <li>Ongoing AI customization agent</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Feature requests via chat</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Priority support</li>\\\\\\\\n            <li>Advanced analytics</li>\\\\\\\\n          </ul>\\\\\\\\n          <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"btn btn--outline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Explore Demo</a>\\\\\\\\n        </div>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n    </div>\\\\\\\\n  </section>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ======== FAQ ======== -->\\\\\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section section--cream\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">FAQ</p>\\\\\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Questions? We've got answers.</h2>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-list\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <summary>Is it really $5&ndash;20/mo?</summary>\\\\\\\\n          <p>Yes. Wild Lychee is open-source software. The $5&ndash;20/mo covers Run402 hosting (database, file storage, edge functions, subdomain). There are no per-member fees, no usage charges, and no hidden costs. The price scales with your hosting tier, not your member count.</p>\\\\\\\\n        </details>\\\\\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <summary>Do I need technical skills?</summary>\\\\\\\\n          <p>Not with Studio. Tell us about your community, and AI builds your portal in minutes. For the DIY template, basic comfort with deploying web apps is helpful &mdash; but AI agents can handle that too.</p>\\\\\\\\n        </details>\\\\\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <summary>Who owns the data?</summary>\\\\\\\\n          <p>You do. Wild Lychee runs on your own Run402 project with your own database. You can export, migrate, or delete at any time. We never touch your data.</p>\\\\\\\\n        </details>\\\\\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <summary>Can I migrate from Wild Apricot or Circle?</summary>\\\\\\\\n          <p>Yes. Studio can investigate your existing site and migrate your branding, colors, and content structure. Member data can be imported via CSV. See our <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/compare.html\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">comparison page</a> for details.</p>\\\\\\\\n        </details>\\\\\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <summary>What does &ldquo;AI-powered&rdquo; actually mean?</summary>\\\\\\\\n          <p>Six optional AI features run on your own API key (OpenAI or Anthropic): content moderation, auto-translation, newsletter drafts, smart onboarding, member insights, and event recaps. You control what runs, when, and at what cost.</p>\\\\\\\\n        </details>\\\\\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n          <summary>Why is it so affordable?</summary>\\\\\\\\n          <p>Because Wild Lychee is open source and runs on Run402's serverless infrastructure. There's no sales team, no enterprise licensing, and no per-seat revenue model. You pay for hosting, not for software.</p>\\\\\\\\n        </details>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n    </div>\\\\\\\\n  </section>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ======== FINAL CTA ======== -->\\\\\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"section section--indigo final-cta\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <h2 class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Own your member portal.</h2>\\\\\\\\n      <p class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"t-body--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Open source. Flat pricing. AI-powered. Yours forever.</p>\\\\\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"final-cta__buttons\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"btn btn--white btn--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Explore Live Demo &rarr;</a>\\\\\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://github.com/kychee-com/wildlychee\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"btn btn--outline btn--lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"border-color:#fff;color:#fff\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">View on GitHub</a>\\\\\\\\n      </div>\\\\\\\\n    </div>\\\\\\\\n  </section>\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  <!-- ======== FOOTER ======== -->\\\\\\\\n  <footer class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"footer\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\n      <p>\\\\\\\\n        <strong>Wild Lychee</strong> is open source. Built on <a href=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://run402.com\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">Run402</a>.\\\\\\\\n        &ensp;&middot;&ensp;\