 Source Community Platform</p>\\\\n      <h1 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--xl hero__headline\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"max-width:44rem;margin:0 auto 1.5rem\\\\\\\">\\\\n        Own your <em>member portal</em>.\\\\n      </h1>\\\\n      <p class=\\\\\\\"t-body--lg hero__sub\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"max-width:38rem;margin:0 auto 2.5rem\\\\\\\">\\\\n        Wild Lychee gives associations, clubs, churches, and HOAs a complete portal &mdash; member directory, events, forum, announcements, and resources &mdash; on software you control, for <strong style=\\\\\\\"color:var(--ink)\\\\\\\">$5&ndash;20/mo</strong>.\\\\n      </p>\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"hero__ctas\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"justify-content:center\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">Explore Live Demo &rarr;</a>\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"#pricing\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"btn btn--outline btn--lg\\\\\\\">Get a Custom Build &mdash; $29</a>\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"https://github.com/kychee-com/wildlychee\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"btn btn--ghost btn--lg\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">View on GitHub</a>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n      <p class=\\\\\\\"t-body--sm mt-2\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"color:var(--ink-subtle)\\\\\\\">No signup required &middot; Real portal, sample content</p>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"browser-mockup\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"browser-mockup__chrome\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"browser-mockup__dots\\\\\\\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"browser-mockup__url\\\\\\\">eagles.run402.com</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <img src=\\\\\\\"/assets/screenshot-eagles.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Eagles community portal — a fully populated Wild Lychee demo\\\\\\\">\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"hero__stats\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <span class=\\\\\\\"hero__stat\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"hero__stat-dot\\\\\\\"></span> 25 members</span>\\\\n        <span class=\\\\\\\"hero__stat\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"hero__stat-dot\\\\\\\"></span> 10 events</span>\\\\n        <span class=\\\\\\\"hero__stat\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"hero__stat-dot\\\\\\\"></span> Active forum</span>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== PRODUCT TOUR ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--white\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"showcase\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">See It Live</p>\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\">Tour a real portal.</h2>\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-body--lg mt-2\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\\\\\\\">Browse a fully populated demo &mdash; members, events, forum, announcements, reactions, activity feed. No signup required.</p>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-grid\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__img\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <img src=\\\\\\\"/assets/screenshot-eagles.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Eagles homepage\\\\\\\">\\\\n          </div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__body\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__name\\\\\\\">Homepage &amp; Activity Feed</span>\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__link\\\\\\\">Browse &rarr;</span>\\\\n          </div>\\\\n        </a>\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com/directory.html\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__img\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <img src=\\\\\\\"/assets/screenshot-eagles-directory.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Member directory\\\\\\\">\\\\n          </div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__body\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__name\\\\\\\">Member Directory</span>\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__link\\\\\\\">Browse &rarr;</span>\\\\n          </div>\\\\n        </a>\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com/events.html\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__img\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <img src=\\\\\\\"/assets/screenshot-eagles-events.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Events and RSVP\\\\\\\">\\\\n          </div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__body\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__name\\\\\\\">Events &amp; RSVP</span>\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__link\\\\\\\">Browse &rarr;</span>\\\\n          </div>\\\\n        </a>\\\\n        <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com/forum.html\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__img\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <img src=\\\\\\\"/assets/screenshot-eagles-forum.png\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Forum discussions\\\\\\\">\\\\n          </div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__body\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__name\\\\\\\">Forum Discussions</span>\\\\n            <span class=\\\\\\\"tour-tile__link\\\\\\\">Browse &rarr;</span>\\\\n          </div>\\\\n        </a>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== BENEFITS ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--cream\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">Why Wild Lychee</p>\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\">Why organizations choose Wild Lychee.</h2>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"benefits-grid\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128176;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__title\\\\\\\">Predictable cost</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__desc\\\\\\\">No per-member fees. $5&ndash;20/mo flat, whether you have 50 members or 5,000. The price scales with your hosting tier, not your headcount.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128274;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__title\\\\\\\">You own everything</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__desc\\\\\\\">Your data, your branding, your domain. Open source &mdash; fork it, modify it, it's yours. No lock-in, no export fees, no surprises.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#129302;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__title\\\\\\\">AI does the work</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"benefit-card__desc\\\\\\\">Studio builds your portal in 5 minutes. Pro keeps it evolving with ongoing AI customization. Or customize it yourself &mdash; it's just HTML and SQL.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"compare-link\\\\\\\">\\\\n        Switching from Wild Apricot, Circle, or Bettermode? <a href=\\\\\\\"/compare.html\\\\\\\">See the full comparison.</a>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== HOW IT WORKS ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--white\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">Get Started</p>\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\">How it works.</h2>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"steps-grid\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__number\\\\\\\">1</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__title\\\\\\\">Pick a template</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__desc\\\\\\\">Choose your community type &mdash; church, HOA, sports league, association &mdash; or start with the default.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__number\\\\\\\">2</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__title\\\\\\\">AI builds your portal</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__desc\\\\\\\">Studio investigates your existing site, asks a few questions, and generates a custom portal in minutes.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__number\\\\\\\">3</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__title\\\\\\\">Launch and customize</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"step-card__desc\\\\\\\">Deploy to your domain. Edit content inline. Toggle features on and off. It's yours.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== FEATURES ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--cream section--dotted\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"features\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">Everything You Need</p>\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\">One template. Every feature.</h2>\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-body--lg mt-2\\\\\\\">All features ship. Toggle them on with a config flag. No plugins, no marketplace, no upsells.</p>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-grid\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128101;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Member Directory</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Searchable profiles with custom fields, tiers, and role-based access.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128197;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Events &amp; RSVP</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Calendar with capacity tracking, reminders, and attendee management.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128226;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Announcements</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Rich text posts with emoji reactions. Pin the important ones.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128218;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Resource Library</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Files, links, and documents with member-only access control.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128172;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Forum</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Categories, topics, threaded replies, and moderation tools.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#127963;&#65039;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Committees</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Working groups with roles, member assignments, and descriptions.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#9999;&#65039;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Inline Editing</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">The page IS the admin panel. Click to edit, no separate dashboard.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#9889;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__name\\\\\\\">Config-Driven</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"feature-card__desc\\\\\\\">Restructure your entire site with SQL. No code changes needed.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== AI FEATURES ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section ai-section\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"ai\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">AI-Powered</p>\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\">Six AI features. Your API key.</h2>\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-body--lg mt-2\\\\\\\">Every AI feature is optional, bring-your-own-key, and runs on your schedule. No vendor lock-in. No surprise bills from us.</p>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-grid\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128737;&#65039;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\">Content Moderation</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\">Auto-flag spam and toxicity. Review queue for admins. Runs every 15 minutes.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#127760;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\">Auto-Translation</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\">Publish once, serve in any language. Triggered on content publish.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128240;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\">Newsletter Writer</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\">AI drafts your weekly update from recent activity. You approve and send.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#127919;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\">Smart Onboarding</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\">Personalized welcome message for each new member based on their profile.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128202;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\">Member Insights</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\">Spot at-risk members before they leave. Daily analysis of engagement patterns.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__icon\\\\\\\">&#128221;</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__name\\\\\\\">Event Recaps</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-card__desc\\\\\\\">AI writes the post-event summary from attendance and photos. You approve it.</div>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"ai-byok\\\\\\\">\\\\n        &#128273;&ensp; Bring your own API key. Your AI, your cost, your control.\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== WHO IT'S FOR ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--cream\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"niches\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">Who It's For