ome-verified deployment</li>\\\\n          </ul>\\\\n          <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"btn btn--primary\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">See a Demo First &rarr;</a>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"plan-card\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"plan-card__name\\\\\\\">Lychee Pro</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"plan-card__price\\\\\\\">$9&ndash;29/mo</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"plan-card__price-sub\\\\\\\">ongoing, cancel anytime</div>\\\\n          <div class=\\\\\\\"plan-card__desc\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\"Your portal evolves with you.\\\\\\\"</div>\\\\n          <ul class=\\\\\\\"plan-card__features\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <li>Ongoing AI customization agent</li>\\\\n            <li>Feature requests via chat</li>\\\\n            <li>Priority support</li>\\\\n            <li>Advanced analytics</li>\\\\n          </ul>\\\\n          <a href=\\\\\\\"https://eagles.run402.com\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"btn btn--outline\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">Explore Demo</a>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== FAQ ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--cream\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"faq\\\\\\\">\\\\n    <div class=\\\\\\\"container\\\\\\\">\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"section-header section-header--center\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <p class=\\\\\\\"t-overline\\\\\\\">FAQ</p>\\\\n        <h2 class=\\\\\\\"t-display t-display--lg\\\\\\\">Questions? We've got answers.</h2>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n\\\\n      <div class=\\\\\\\"faq-list\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <summary>Is it really $5&ndash;20/mo?</summary>\\\\n          <p>Yes. Wild Lychee is open-source software. The $5&ndash;20/mo covers Run402 hosting (database, file storage, edge functions, subdomain). There are no per-member fees, no usage charges, and no hidden costs. The price scales with your hosting tier, not your member count.</p>\\\\n        </details>\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <summary>Do I need technical skills?</summary>\\\\n          <p>Not with Studio. Tell us about your community, and AI builds your portal in minutes. For the DIY template, basic comfort with deploying web apps is helpful &mdash; but AI agents can handle that too.</p>\\\\n        </details>\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <summary>Who owns the data?</summary>\\\\n          <p>You do. Wild Lychee runs on your own Run402 project with your own database. You can export, migrate, or delete at any time. We never touch your data.</p>\\\\n        </details>\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <summary>Can I migrate from Wild Apricot or Circle?</summary>\\\\n          <p>Yes. Studio can investigate your existing site and migrate your branding, colors, and content structure. Member data can be imported via CSV. See our <a href=\\\\\\\"/compare.html\\\\\\\">comparison page</a> for details.</p>\\\\n        </details>\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <summary>What does &ldquo;AI-powered&rdquo; actually mean?</summary>\\\\n          <p>Six optional AI features run on your own API key (OpenAI or Anthropic): content moderation, auto-translation, newsletter drafts, smart onboarding, member insights, and event recaps. You control what runs, when, and at what cost.</p>\\\\n        </details>\\\\n        <details class=\\\\\\\"faq-item\\\\\\\">\\\\n          <summary>Why is it so affordable?</summary>\\\\n          <p>Because Wild Lychee is open source and runs on Run402's serverless infrastructure. There's no sales team, no enterprise licensing, and no per-seat revenue model. You pay for hosting, not for software.</p>\\\\n        </details>\\\\n      </div>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  </section>\\\\n\\\\n  <!-- ======== FINAL CTA ======== -->\\\\n  <section class=\\\\\\\"section section--indigo final-c